<title>UK: Monument names UK ex-minister Eggar director.</title>
<headline>Monument names UK ex-minister Eggar director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Monument Oil and Gas Plc confirmed on Thursday the appointment of former British energy minister Tim Eggar as a non-executive director of the company.</p>
<p>Monument said that Eggar would also be partially responsible for expanding its overseas activities including the Caspian Sea region.</p>
<p>Eggar has already announced he would not be standing for re-election to parliament at the next election, due by mid-May.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
